   "body": "/claim mac/M1\n\n- Replace the `.quaternary` fill of the GIF search field by the system glass (`glassEffect(.regular)`), as the composer card and the smiley notice do (LOT-185: glass for floating elements); the grid still runs under the bar.\n- Glass adapts to Reduce Transparency / Increase Contrast by itself; no hand-made fill.\n- Stay inside `GifPickerView.swift`; behaviour (submit, clear, disabled when idle, labels) unchanged.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
